# Third-party and archival materials

## Software (this repository)

All of the following are first-party project code, released under the **MIT License** (see `LICENSE`):

| Path | Description |
|------|-------------|
| `src/` | SEISF Path D decoder and Python VUS port |
| `vusinfo/` | Original C **VUS / USEIS** cassette decoder (**Yukio Yamamoto**) |

The Python module `src/vus_decode.py` is a port of the bit-stream logic in `vusinfo/`.

## Archival scientific documentation and listings

Bundled PDFs and the N51SUB listing photograph are **historical Viking-project / ground-processing materials** previously distributed through UTIG (University of Texas Institute for Geophysics) pages that later disappeared after the responsible investigator retired.

They are included **for scholarly reproducibility of the SEISF decode path**, not as a claim of exclusive ownership. If a rights holder objects, contact the repository maintainers for removal or replacement with a literature pointer.

| Path (typical) | Description |
|----------------|-------------|
| `materials/PD7400072.pdf` | Hardware buffer / DAPU readout (SD-37D000 / PD7400072 family) |
| `materials/VUSFormat.pdf` | VUS / USEIS cassette frame format |
| `materials/VikingSeisDataSetDescription.pdf` | Seismic data set description |
| `materials/VikingASCIIFileDescription.pdf` | ASCII EDR-style file description |
| `materials/N51SUB.jpg` | Photograph of N51SUB assembly listing (SEISDT / UNSCR / BOUT) |

## Cassette data (not redistributed)

UTIG `vkg.*` 8 mm cassette images and NSSDC volumes are **not** shipped in this repository. Obtain them from the original archives under their terms; place locally under `utig/` for tests.
